# Changes for Net::PublicSuffixList

0.99_02 2026-11-26T09:41:00Z
	* Fix Changes
	* handle exceptions

0.99_01 2026-11-26T09:36:00Z
	* Fix CVE-2026-129978: host and suffix lookups are case-insensitive.
	* Fix CVE-2026-129979: internationalized suffixes and hosts match in
	  either Unicode or punycode form. This adds Net::IDN::Encode as a
	  prerequisite.
	* Fix CVE-2026-129980: suffixes_in no longer does quadratic work on
	  hosts with many labels. It checks no more labels than the deepest
	  rule has.
	* Fix CVE-2026-129977: wildcard rules such as *.ck are stored with
	  their marker and match exactly one label, so *.ck no longer makes
	  ck itself a public suffix. parse_list no longer strips the leading
	  *. from rules.
	* add_suffix rejects invalid suffixes (such as *, *foo, *.*.com, or
	  labels with spaces or underscores) with a warning. A single leading
	  dot is stripped, so .*.com is the wildcard rule *.com.

0.504 2026-11-16T04:43:20Z
	* silence a warning (#11)

0.503 2024-02-11T22:14:34Z
	* refresh distro, update email address, move to BRIANDFOY

0.502 2022-03-19T15:56:32Z
	* Freshen distro and correct some LICENSE issues. No code changes.

0.501 2021-01-29T01:40:22Z
	* Fix a problem with line-endings on Windows.

0.500 2020-01-08T04:33:18Z
	* Make this a user release

0.001_01 2020-01-08T03:55:52Z
